    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n96476" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στενᾰχ-ίζω</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στονᾰχίζω</span></b>  (the latter form is a freq. v.l. in
		<i><span class="en">
			Hom.
		</span></i>), 
